Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:10:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/16] A remedy per stop code in the verdict and the CLI
 output (gap rank 15, chaos G1)

verdict.mjs REMEDIES and remedyOf(run): for every stop (failed, cancelled, uncertain,
parked on an outage, waiting, awaiting a person or an approval) the cause, whether the
run can continue and the next action, naming real commands. Terminal verdicts seal it as
verdict.remedy; Foundry.publicRun adds it to run/resume/inspect/answer output and MCP.
G1's extraction also reads remedyOf(record) (its checks are unchanged): a parked run has
no error and no verdict. tests/verdict.test.mjs also registers TOKEN_BUDGET (patch 09).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
